This is a working _non released_ stoopid, door that just does a CLS, 
and prints a banner before doing a function 24, ie Direct Download, oh yeah
it also allows you to download multiple files without having to go through
the menu constantly.

Could be modified to accept passwords, use wildchars, etc, etc.

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   D      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:DirectDownLoad/DirectDownLoad


